{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "15e60c2a-9fb6-8113-8e22-8e9045ec9bc3",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T12:44:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:39:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. I'm sorry, I'm whispering. Somebody's asleep in the next room. I got a parking ticket and I'm not happy about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Tell me about the ticket."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says I parked during the snow ban. Well, the street was never plowed. Not once. And there was no sign posted either. Not a one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:40:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So you're saying no plow came through and no ban signage was up where you were parked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Nothing. I'd have moved the car if anybody had told me. Instead I get a piece of paper under the wiper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number off it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:40:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on. [pause] I have it here on the counter next to my coupons. I'm clipping coupons from the Sunday paper, so it's a mess in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like a productive Friday. Go ahead whenever you've found the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:40:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, it's a long one. Four, four, one, seven, zero, eight, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:40:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four four one seven zero eight two. Let me pull that up. [pause] Okay, I see it. Snow emergency violation, and it's showing a hundred and twenty-five dollars due."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A hundred and twenty-five dollars for a street nobody plowed. Honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:41:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Now, you can contest it, but I'll tell you how that works. If you want to dispute it, you'd send a written appeal. If you pay it, that generally closes the matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:41:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Where do I send the written appeal? I'd like to do that. But I also don't want it going to some late fee while they read it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair question. Appeals go by mail to the City of Newport, attention Finance Department, parking violations, at City Hall. Put your ticket number on the letter, your name, your phone, and explain what you told me about the plowing and the signs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:41:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you say that slower? I'm writing on the back of a coupon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:41:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. City of Newport. Finance Department. Attention parking violations. City Hall. Newport, Rhode Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:42:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. And if they deny it I'm out the money anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:42:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Possibly, yes. Some people pay now so there's no penalty risk, and some appeal first. It's your call. I can't tell you how a review will come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:42:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well. I'd better pay it today, then. I'll write the letter too. Can I pay with a card right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can. Whenever you're ready, give me the card number, then the expiration."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:42:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Five five five five, five five five five, five five five five, four four four four. Expiration is eleven, twenty-eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:42:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Let me read that back. Five five five five, five five five five, five five five five, four four four four, expiring eleven twenty-eight, for a hundred and twenty-five dollars. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Do you have the three-digit security code on the back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Hang on. [pause] It's seven, three, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:12-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. That went through. You'll get a receipt number in a moment. It's one two five zero, I mean, hold on, let me say that again once it's printed. [pause] I'll note on the account that you're sending a written appeal, so they know it's coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Will I get my money back if they agree with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the appeal is granted, a refund would be handled after that decision. The letter will tell you what happens next."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. It's just annoying. I did nothing wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Put that in the letter, in those words if you like. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:43:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all. Thank you, Luis. I have to go, he's stirring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T12:44:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care, and good luck with the coupons."
    }
  ],
